   *  by the wrapped Filter.
   *  <p>This implementation returns the given {@link DocIdSet}, if {@link DocIdSet#isCacheable}
   *  returns <code>true</code>, else it copies the {@link DocIdSetIterator} into
   *  an {@link FixedBitSet}.
